# Shanks American Atlas TIME TABLE, North Idaho panhandle 1961-DST-resumer towns (Shanks ID #1): Pacific, resumed summer PDT in 1961-1963 -- three years before the dominant ID #2 (PST until 1964). IANA America/Los_Angeles applies California DST 1961-63 so those summers match IANA, but the flat Etc/GMT+8 panhandle override wrongly forces PST. Visual-verified from the crop (PDF 122)..
